{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Spooky Lord</strong> \u2013 a tactical strategy game where you are the nightmare. As a supernatural commander, you lead a squad of ghostly entities: from house-haunting specters and mischievous gremlins to vengeful apparitions from beyond. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal isn\u2019t always just to scare \u2013 sometimes stealth, manipulation, or puzzle-solving is the key. With 10 playable ghost characters, each with their own powers and personality, you\u2019ll develop your own style of haunting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky Lord</strong> brings the concept into the modern age: more freedom, polished mechanics, and a fresh look.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931390?t=1757962502","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931390/6265d16ab8b675f11256cd9480973b30d8b90812/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757962502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931390/9be4d00b4fe8a37eb0ab0f380cbd9539f2eee5b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757962502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931390/9be4d00b4fe8a37eb0ab0f380cbd9539f2eee5b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757962502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Spooky Lord</strong> \u2013 a tactical strategy game where you are the nightmare. As a supernatural commander, you lead a squad of ghostly entities: from house-haunting specters and mischievous gremlins to vengeful apparitions from beyond. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal isn\u2019t always just to scare \u2013 sometimes stealth, manipulation, or puzzle-solving is the